  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rent/maintenance Midtermolen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant has covered the costs related to the UN Centre on Midtermolen in Copenhagen. The UN Centre was established in 1996 and housed a number of the UN organisations in Copenhagen, including UNOPS, which moved its HQ to Copenhagen in 2006, and the Nordic Office of UNDP, UNFPA and WFP.

The organisations have now moved to the UN City in Copenhagen.</narrative>
  </description>
